" [1 Devices] 2 3 4 7 | BIP 10.0.0.1:47808 | up | READ-ONLY | drop 0      ? help "
"┌┌ Help (? or Esc to close) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐┐"
"││ Global                                                                     ││"
"││   ?                This help; Up, Down, PgUp and PgDn scroll it            ││"
"││   q                Quit (asks first while writes are in effect)            ││"
"││   Ctrl-C           Close a dialog or cancel the request; twice quits       ││"
"││   L                Show or hide the log pane                               ││"
"││   W u              Arm or disarm writes (read-only until then); the ledger ││"
"││   :                The command bar, with the commands listed below         ││"
"││   p c              The profile dialog; connect again, or retry             ││"
"││   1 2              Devices; 2 is Browse, the open device's browser         ││"
"││   3 4 5 6 7        Watch, Network, SC, MS/TP, Capture; see the top line    ││"
"││ Devices (1)                                                                ││"
"││   d                The Who-Is form                                         ││"
"││   Enter            Browse the selected device                              ││"
"││   Up Down k j      Move                                                    ││"
"││   PgUp PgDn        A page up or down                                       ││"
"││   Home End g G     The first or last row                                   ││"
"││   / s S            Filter (Esc clears it); sort by the next column; reverse││"
"││   x                Disconnect, or cancel a connection attempt              ││"
"││   Esc              Clear the filter, or a notice                           ││"
"││ Browse (2), once a device is open                                          ││"
